#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:7
msgid "TVM Logging Overview"
msgstr "TVM 日志系统概述"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:9
msgid ""
"Tilelang currently utilizes the logging system from TVM. The implementation "
"can be found in:"
msgstr "Tilelang 当前使用 TVM 的日志系统。其实现位于以下文件中："

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:11
msgid ""
"[include/tvm/runtime/logging.h](https://github.com/apache/tvm/blob/main/"
"include/tvm/runtime/logging.h): Macro definitions"
msgstr ""
"[include/tvm/runtime/logging.h](https://github.com/apache/tvm/blob/main/"
"include/tvm/runtime/logging.h)：宏定义"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:12
msgid ""
"[src/runtime/logging.cc](https://github.com/apache/tvm/blob/main/src/runtime/"
"logging.cc): Logging logic implementation"
msgstr ""
"[src/runtime/logging.cc](https://github.com/apache/tvm/blob/main/src/runtime/"
"logging.cc)：日志逻辑实现"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:14
msgid ""
"The design style is inspired by [Google's glog](https://google.github.io/"
"glog/stable/)."
msgstr "其设计风格借鉴了 [Google glog](https://google.github.io/glog/stable/)。"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:16
msgid "Logging Categories"
msgstr "日志类别"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:18
msgid "There are three primary macro types:"
msgstr "主要有三种宏类型："

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:20
msgid ""
"LOG(INFO) << \"aaa\";\n"
"DLOG(INFO) << \"aaa\";\n"
"VLOG(1) << \"aaa\";\n"
msgstr ""
"LOG(INFO) << \"aaa\";\n"
"DLOG(INFO) << \"aaa\";\n"
"VLOG(1) << \"aaa\";\n"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:26
msgid ""
"**LOG**: Standard logging preserved in code for displaying necessary "
"information at different levels during runtime. Most Tilelang C++ error "
"reporting is implemented via `LOG(FATAL) << \"error msg\"`."
msgstr ""
"**LOG**：标准日志，保留在代码中，用于在运行时按不同级别显示必要信息。"
"大多数 Tilelang C++ 错误报告通过 `LOG(FATAL) << \"error msg\"` 实现。"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:27
msgid ""
"**DLOG**: Debug logging for developer debugging output. DLOG is controlled "
"at build time by the TVM_LOG_DEBUG environment variable and is **eliminated "
"in Release builds through dead code elimination**."
msgstr ""
"**DLOG**：调试日志，用于开发者调试输出。DLOG 在编译时由 TVM_LOG_DEBUG 环境"
"变量控制，并**在 Release 构建中通过死代码消除被移除**。"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:28
msgid ""
"The key difference between LOG(DEBUG) and DLOG is this build-time "
"elimination. We recommend using DLOG over LOG(DEBUG), as the latter has "
"overlapping functionality and gets compiled into the release runtime."
msgstr ""
"LOG(DEBUG) 与 DLOG 的关键区别在于这种编译时消除。我们建议使用 DLOG 而非 "
"LOG(DEBUG)，因为后者功能重叠且会被编译进 Release 运行时。"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:29
msgid ""
"**VLOG**: [Verbose logging](https://google.github.io/glog/stable/logging/"
"#verbose-logging), primarily for debugging. Its main feature is customizable "
"verbosity levels. For example, VLOG(n) where n can be 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, or 6, "
"enabling complex tracing requirements. In contrast, LOG and DLOG typically "
"use predefined verbose levels like INFO and DEBUG."
msgstr ""
"**VLOG**：[详细日志](https://google.github.io/glog/stable/logging/"
"#verbose-logging)，主要用于调试。其主要特点是可自定义详细级别。"
"例如 `VLOG(n)` 中 `n` 可以为 1、2、3、4、5 或 6，从而满足复杂的追踪需求。"
"相比之下，LOG 和 DLOG 通常使用预定义的详细级别，如 INFO 和 DEBUG。"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:30
msgid "In practical Tilelang development, VLOG is used less frequently."
msgstr "在实际 Tilelang 开发中，VLOG 的使用频率较低。"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:31
msgid ""
"TVM's VLOG is implemented using DLOG, thus inheriting DLOG's characteristics."
msgstr "TVM 的 VLOG 基于 DLOG 实现，因此继承了 DLOG 的特性。"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:33
msgid "Additional useful macros include various **CHECK** variants:"
msgstr "其他有用的宏包括各种 **CHECK** 变体："

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:35
msgid ""
"CHECK(cond) << \"error msg\";\n"
"DCHECK(cond) << \"error msg\";\n"
"ICHECK(cond) << \"error msg\";\n"
msgstr ""
"CHECK(cond) << \"error msg\";\n"
"DCHECK(cond) << \"error msg\";\n"
"ICHECK(cond) << \"error msg\";\n"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:41
msgid "The implementation routes errors to LogFatal:"
msgstr "其实现将错误路由到 LogFatal："

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:43
msgid ""
"#define CHECK(x)                                                \\\n"
"  if (!(x))                                                     \\\n"
"  ::tvm::runtime::detail::LogFatal(__FILE__, __LINE__).stream() \\\n"
"      << \"Check failed: (\" #x << \") is false: \"\n"
msgstr ""
"#define CHECK(x)                                                \\\n"
"  if (!(x))                                                     \\\n"
"  ::tvm::runtime::detail::LogFatal(__FILE__, __LINE__).stream() \\\n"
"      << \"Check failed: (\" #x << \") is false: \"\n"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:49
msgid "**DCHECK**: Debug mode CHECK, only compiled in debug builds"
msgstr "**DCHECK**：调试模式下的 CHECK，仅在 Debug 构建中编译"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:50
msgid ""
"**ICHECK**: Internal Check that should exist in Release builds. When ICHECK "
"fails, the entire system should report an error."
msgstr ""
"**ICHECK**：内部检查，应存在于 Release 构建中。当 ICHECK 失败时，整个系统应"
"报告错误。"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:52
msgid "Logging Verbose Levels"
msgstr "日志详细级别"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:54
msgid "TVM defines 5 levels for LOG and DLOG (adding DEBUG compared to glog):"
msgstr "TVM 为 LOG 和 DLOG 定义了 5 个级别（相比 glog 增加了 DEBUG）："

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:56
msgid ""
"#define TVM_LOG_LEVEL_DEBUG 0\n"
"#define TVM_LOG_LEVEL_INFO 1\n"
"#define TVM_LOG_LEVEL_WARNING 2\n"
"#define TVM_LOG_LEVEL_ERROR 3\n"
"#define TVM_LOG_LEVEL_FATAL 4\n"
msgstr ""
"#define TVM_LOG_LEVEL_DEBUG 0\n"
"#define TVM_LOG_LEVEL_INFO 1\n"
"#define TVM_LOG_LEVEL_WARNING 2\n"
"#define TVM_LOG_LEVEL_ERROR 3\n"
"#define TVM_LOG_LEVEL_FATAL 4\n"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:64
msgid "Using Logging in TileLang Development"
msgstr "在 TileLang 开发中使用日志"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:66
msgid "Guidelines"
msgstr "使用指南"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:68
msgid ""
"For temporary debugging output in your code, there are no restrictions (you "
"can even use std::cout). Just remember to remove it before submitting a PR."
msgstr ""
"对于临时代码调试输出，没有限制（甚至可以使用 std::cout）。只需记住在提交 PR "
"前将其删除。"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:70
msgid "For meaningful logging that should remain in the Tilelang codebase:"
msgstr "对于应保留在 Tilelang 代码库中的有意义日志："

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:72
msgid ""
"Critical correctness checks: Use ICHECK with sufficient error messages to "
"facilitate debugging when issues arise."
msgstr ""
"关键正确性检查：使用 ICHECK 并附带充分的错误信息，以便在出现问题时便于调试。"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:73
msgid ""
"Complex Pass debugging: For passes requiring intermediate output that may "
"need future review (e.g., LayoutInference), use DLOG."
msgstr ""
"复杂 Pass 调试：对于需要中间输出、可能需要未来审查的 Pass"
"（例如 LayoutInference），使用 DLOG。"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:74
msgid "General INFO/WARNING messages: Use standard LOG."
msgstr "一般 INFO/WARNING 消息：使用标准 LOG。"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:76
msgid "Enabling Log Output in Tilelang"
msgstr "在 Tilelang 中启用日志输出"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:78
msgid ""
"To specify current log level at runtime, we need to set the environment "
"variable `TVM_LOG_LEVEL`. An example usage is:"
msgstr ""
"要在运行时指定当前日志级别，需要设置环境变量 `TVM_LOG_LEVEL`。"
"用法示例如下："

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:80
msgid "TVM_LOG_DEBUG=1 python3 code.py\n"
msgstr "TVM_LOG_DEBUG=1 python3 code.py\n"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:84
msgid "which enables all DEBUG/INFO (level <= 1) logs for all files."
msgstr "这将启用所有文件中所有 DEBUG/INFO（级别 <= 1）的日志。"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:86
msgid "Detailed Rules for TVM_LOG_DEBUG Specification"
msgstr "TVM_LOG_DEBUG 规范详解"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:88
msgid ""
"The parsing logic is in `logging.cc`. Reference: [HyperAI Zhihu Article]"
"(https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1933106843468665163)."
msgstr ""
"解析逻辑位于 `logging.cc` 中。参考：[HyperAI 知乎文章]"
"(https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1933106843468665163)。"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:90
msgid ""
"Launch Python with `TVM_LOG_DEBUG=<spec>`, where `<spec>` is a comma-"
"separated list of level assignments in the form `<file_name>=<level>`. "
"Important notes:"
msgstr ""
"使用 `TVM_LOG_DEBUG=<spec>` 启动 Python，其中 `<spec>` 是以逗号分隔的级别"
"分配列表，格式为 `<file_name>=<level>`。注意事项："

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:92
msgid "The special filename DEFAULT sets the LOG level for all files."
msgstr "特殊文件名 DEFAULT 用于设置所有文件的 LOG 级别。"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:93
msgid "`<level>` can be set to -1 to disable LOG for that file."
msgstr "`<level>` 可以设置为 -1 以禁用该文件的 LOG。"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:94
msgid ""
"`<file_name>` is the C++ source filename (e.g., .cc, not .h) relative to the "
"`src/` directory in the TVM repository. The `src/` prefix is optional when "
"specifying file paths."
msgstr ""
"`<file_name>` 是 C++ 源文件名（例如 .cc 而非 .h），相对于 TVM 仓库中的 "
"`src/` 目录。指定文件路径时，`src/` 前缀是可选的。"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:96
msgid "Enabling Debug Mode"
msgstr "启用调试模式"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:98
msgid ""
"To enable DLOG/DCHECK, developers need to first build Tilelang in Debug mode:"
msgstr "要启用 DLOG/DCHECK，开发者需要首先以 Debug 模式构建 Tilelang："

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:100
msgid "cmake .. -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Debug -DUSE_CUDA=ON\n"
msgstr "cmake .. -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Debug -DUSE_CUDA=ON\n"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:104
msgid ""
"Tilelang's CMake logic automatically adds the `TVM_LOG_DEBUG` macro, "
"compiling all DLOG statements:"
msgstr ""
"Tilelang 的 CMake 逻辑会自动添加 `TVM_LOG_DEBUG` 宏，编译所有 DLOG 语句："

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:106
msgid "target_compile_definitions(tilelang_objs PRIVATE \"TVM_LOG_DEBUG\")\n"
msgstr "target_compile_definitions(tilelang_objs PRIVATE \"TVM_LOG_DEBUG\")\n"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:110
msgid ""
"Then you also need to specify the runtime environment variables. For "
"example, to use `DLOG(INFO) << \"xxx\"` for debugging, run your code with "
"INFO level (1): `TVM_LOG_DEBUG=1`."
msgstr ""
"然后还需要指定运行时环境变量。例如，要使用 `DLOG(INFO) << \"xxx\"` 进行调试，"
"以 INFO 级别 (1) 运行代码：`TVM_LOG_DEBUG=1`。"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:113
msgid ""
"**Important**: There are two TVM_LOG_DEBUG variables. (1) Compile-time "
"macro: Determines whether debug content (like DLOG) is compiled into the .so "
"file. Referenced in C++ source via #ifdef TVM_LOG_DEBUG. This is "
"automatically enabled when using Debug build mode in CMake. (2) Runtime "
"environment variable: Controls logging level at runtime. TVM provides a "
"specification for this variable, allowing control over per-file logging "
"levels."
msgstr ""
"**重要提示**：存在两个 TVM_LOG_DEBUG 变量。(1) 编译时宏：决定调试内容（"
"如 DLOG）是否被编译到 .so 文件中。在 C++ 源代码中通过 `#ifdef TVM_LOG_DEBUG` "
"引用。使用 CMake Debug 构建模式时自动启用。(2) 运行时环境变量：在运行时控制"
"日志级别。TVM 为该变量提供了规范，允许控制每个文件的日志级别。"

#: ../../../tutorials/logging.md:115
msgid ""
"These two should ideally have different names, but TVM uses the same name "
"for both, which can cause confusion."
msgstr ""
"这两个变量理应采用不同的名称，但 TVM 对两者使用了相同的名称，这可能会造成"
"混淆。"
